---
import AboutHeroImage from "../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg";
import Layout from "../layouts/BlogPost.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Me"
  description="Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet"
  pubDate={new Date("December 25 2025")}
  heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="language-section chinese">
      <p>
        我是一名算法竞赛的 <strong>入门爱好者</strong>，目前主要活跃在
        AtCoder、NowCoder (牛客)、Codeforces 和 LeetCode 等平台的周赛中。
      </p>

      <p>
        这个博客是我进行 <strong>算法学习总结和存档</strong> 的业余空间。我的核心目标是：
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>赛后复盘</strong>：
          记录每一次算法竞赛的学习进度，并提供详细、步骤清晰的算法解题报告。
        </li>
        <br />
        <li>
          <strong>知识共享</strong>：
          将这些学习成果分享给其他算法爱好者，希望能够为大家提供清晰、有价值的解题报告。
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="feedback-note">
        算法之路漫漫，我非常欢迎各位提出建议和反馈。如果您对任何解法有更优的想法，或者发现任何错误，请随时与我联系！
      </p>
    </div>

    <hr aria-hidden="true" />

    <div class="language-section english">
      <p>
        I am an algorithm competition enthusiast, primarily participating in
        weekly contests on platforms like AtCoder, NowCoder, Codeforces, and
        LeetCode.
      </p>

      <p>
        This blog serves as my personal space for tracking my progress through
        weekly contests and archiving detailed, step-by-step problem solutions.
        My core goals are:
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Post-contest Debrief</strong>: To meticulously document my
          problem-solving approach, code implementations, and complexity
          analysis for future review.
        </li>
        <br />
        <li>
          <strong>Knowledge Sharing</strong>: To share these learning reports
          with fellow algorithm enthusiasts, aiming to provide clear and
          valuable insights into various solutions.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="feedback-note">
        The journey in algorithms is ongoing, and I highly welcome any
        suggestions or feedback. If you have a more efficient approach to any
        solution or spot any errors, please feel free to reach out and let me
        know!
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
